;; clj-kondo config for the LightTable fork.
;;
;; `lt.macros/defui` (a singultus-backed UI-element macro) defines a named var
;; from `(defui name [bindings] body…)`, but clj-kondo can't see through the
;; macro and reports the defined name + its bindings as unresolved symbols.
;; Linting it as `defn` makes the name a def and the bindings params — removing
;; the false-positive "Unresolved symbol" errors without hiding real ones.
{:lint-as {lt.macros/defui clojure.core/defn}}
